## CQ-CC13-01 | config watcher: edit a Common config file while the game runs, the change loads without a restart
@group client
@commands Full pack client in a world: open `config/creativecommon-common.toml`, change a value with a visible effect (for example an `[effects] levelCaps` entry or `[melting] meltTickInterval`), save; read `logs/latest.log`
@pass log shows the watcher noticing the file and the Forge reload path running once after the 1 s debounce; the new value is in effect without a restart; saving unchanged content does not reload
@fails `OwnConfigLogic` file filter, debounce, content guard
@draft no steps yet: the owner reads the log and the in-game effect
## CQ-CC13-02 | melt and salt tooltip: salt and saltable blocks show the melting hint
@group client
@commands Full pack client: hover a salt item, an ice block and a snow block in the inventory
@pass the saltable tooltip line shows on the blocks salt melts and the salt item names its use; no tooltip line on blocks it does not melt
@fails saltable tag, tooltip handler, lang keys
@draft no steps yet: the owner reads the tooltips
## CQ-CC13-03 | level-capped effect tooltip: a capped effect shows level I everywhere
@group client
@commands Full pack client: apply a capped effect at level III (`/effect give @s <capped effect> 60 2`), look at the HUD, the inventory effect list, a potion item or wine tooltip and the JEI page
@pass the effect shows level I (no level numeral) in every place; an uncapped effect keeps its level
@fails `[effects] levelCaps` (getAmplifier, tooltip mixins); one display path not capped
@draft no steps yet: the owner looks
